Would this work?

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.900
You can use it in water?

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.500
So you find it satisfactory?

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:47.910
What an amusing situation we find ourselves in.

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:49.950
Yeah, really.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:51.970
So what shall we do from hereafter?

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:53.960
