00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.370
Yup!

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:57.040
But...

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:58.270
But?

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:00.690
Things could get a little too amusing.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:05.430
Geez... You never bore me, you know that?{"Gosh. Never change." to "Geez... You never bore me, you know that?" for character consistency -A0}

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:07.990
Hang on!

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.810
<i>They</i> can't navigate stairs or a steep slope, huh?{"They can use the stairs, but not a sleep slope?" to "They can't navigate stairs or a steep slope, huh?" Italics added -A0}

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.440
Say what you please, but...

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:36.190
It's the same in the end, huh?{"They're" to "It's" for clarity -A0}

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.390
That would be too easy.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:39.880
Well then...

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.760
Komuro-kun, what are you doing?{Name moved to beginning of sentence to match audio -A0}

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:45.930
Using it amphibiously!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:47.700
Amphibiously?

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:56.520
Saeko-san, are you o-kaaay?

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:05.890
Ah, umm, uhh...{"Uhhhhhh." to "Ah, umm, uhh..." taken from TMDs' TL-Komuro is strugging more than just "uhhh" -A0}

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:13.180
I-I am a woman! {WE note: changed this line from "girl" to "woman" in the ep 8 preview for consistency}

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:16.350
Oh, yes! Sorry!{"..." to "!" -A0}

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:46.790
It is not admirable for a young man to sigh.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:48.080
Uh, okay.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:49.670
But, wait, Saeko-san...

00:05:49.730 --> 00:05:50.370
You're too close...

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:53.380
How about you keep your voice down now?

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.580
Good idea to use the sandbank.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:07.840
I remember when I was a kid and I was always told not to play here

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:12.470
because the water is so deep and the stream is really fast.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:14.350
Now then.

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:19.020
Regardless of whether this plan works out or not, we should rest.{"things work" to "this plan works" for clarity -A0}

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.810
Okay. We'll take turns standing guard.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.720
Saeko-san, you can rest firs—

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:31.460
I-I apologize... My body seems to have gotten cold.

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:33.680
Oh yeah. We got splashed before...

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:40.400
Well, you can use this for now.

00:06:42.090 --> 00:06:42.700
Thank you.

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:10.880
You can turn around now.

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:18.450
Do I look strange?

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:19.990
N-No!

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.110
It's the other way around!

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:21.730
Uh.

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:27.870
Komuro-kun, you always look at me as a woman, don't you?{Name moved to beginning of sentence to match audio -A0}

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:29.350
Uh... Would you rather...

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:30.750
Sor—

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:31.500
It is fine.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:33.680
I am a woman, aren't I?

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:47.120
U-Umm... Saeko-san, is there someone you like?{Added "U-Umm..." & name moved to beginning of sentence to match audio -A0}

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:49.990
That came out of the blue.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:51.240
Er, well...

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.160
What the hell am I saying...

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:58.060
I just thought...

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.300
There is...

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:06.290
...a man whom I like.

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:14.450
Should we leave now?

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:15.630
There are less of <i>them</i>.{Italics added -A0}

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:17.810
Ah, yeah.

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:35.910
More of <i>them</i>.{Italics added -A0}

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:38.570
As it stands, we will just have a repeat of the sandbank.

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:41.370
We'll know when we turn at the next corner!

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:46.770
A park?

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.810
Doesn't mean we have to make a cardboard box house!

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:07.800
Do you like making girls wet? {W.E. note:  AAAAHAHAHAHAHAHA~~~!!!}

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.840
Get the tape out of the backpack!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.340
I see.

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:29.760
While <i>they</i> are drawn in by the noise...{Italics added -A0}

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:33.930
We can go out the east exit,
 and we'll end up behind Takagi's house.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:38.560
I don't wanna use the gun very much because of the echo...

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:43.630
I see.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:49.460
Understood!

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:02.000
What a foul smell.

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:04.850
You should at least wash your hair.

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:14.870
Now...

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.110
I have no reason to hold back!

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:25.200
S-Saeko-san, y-you're pretty cool...{Name moved to beginning of sentence to match audio -A0}

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:43.080
What're you doing?! Saeko-san!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.520
What's the matter?

00:10:58.850 --> 00:10:59.470
Here!

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:00.970
Hurry!

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:23.770
What happened, Saeko-san?

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:35.310
Traveling around at night would be dangerous with what supplies we have now.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.280
We'll wait here for morning.

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:54.350
Hey, this is a real sword.

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:58.090
Saeko-san, here you go.{Name moved to beginning of sentence to match audio -A0}

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:03.910
You should sit down over here first.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.330
Your uniform is dry too.

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:40.400
I am done changing.

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:48.220
I feel much better now.

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:50.150
We have one, Saeko-san.

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:52.530
We have one what?

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:55.160
What indeed.

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:56.490
One of these.

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:06.640
This is a portable toilet, Saeko-sama.

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:13.060
Why you...

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:16.410
Hey, don't laugh about that!

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.700
This way, we won't have to worry about...

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:20.360
Yes, I know.

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:23.890
I...

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:25.780
I am happy.

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:37.060
You are not going to pry?

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:42.660
Well, it must be pretty big reason for you to freeze up like that...

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:58.350
It might not mean anything to you...

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.360
But regardless, do you mind hearing me out?

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.830
I recalled when I was last so...

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:14.840
Afraid.

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:19.200
Was it because you saw the children?

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.010
Though troubling, no, that was not it.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:29.750
When we were by the river bank,
 you asked if there was a man whom I liked.

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:32.360
Oh, that, uh...

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:33.720
Do not worry.

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:35.720
I do think like a woman,

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:38.240
and there is a man whom I like.

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:41.140
But...

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:44.020
I did not convey my feelings to him.

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:47.120
I did not believe that I should be allowed to do so.

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:49.950
But why? I mean, no matter what kind of guy...

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:52.380
Do you think he would have accepted me
 if I had committed murder?

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:00.580
It was four years ago.

00:15:01.320 --> 00:15:02.990
A man attacked me at night.

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:08.260
I had my training sword with me,
 so naturally I was able to fend him off.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:13.790
I broke his shoulder blade and femur.

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:19.050
The police understood the situation
 and took me back home in the patrol car.

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:24.040
Then they might have thought it was
 an excessive way to defend yourself...

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:27.640
That is not what has been holding me back.

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:31.400
I enjoyed it.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:35.460
I had a clearly defined enemy.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:38.300
It was thrilling.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:52.390
Once I knew that I was on top because of my training sword,

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:54.230
I pretended to be afraid,

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:55.790
lured him in,

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:04.180
and struck back without hesitation.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:07.560
And I enjoyed it.

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.660
I truly, truly enjoyed it.

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:14.520
That is the real me!

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.730
The true nature of Busujima Saeko!

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:24.120
Do you really believe that I,
 drunk and turned on by my own power,

00:16:24.610 --> 00:16:26.370
should be allowed something pure like love?!{liberal. as. dicks.}

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:30.130
But ever since <i>they</i> appeared, I...{Italics added -A0}

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:36.450
But you changed after the fact.

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:39.060
I have been like this since before it all began.

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:40.880
Saeko-san...

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.410
As we stood in front of the water fountain,

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:45.820
I came to realize that I have not changed.

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:49.190
On the contrary, I find myself becoming even crueler.

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.380
Let's go out the back.

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:46.310
It'll take us 20 minutes to walk to Takagi's—

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:51.570
What the?!

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:54.370
Was it the sound of the leaves?

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:55.870
No, there's no way.

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:58.570
Why?!

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:01.290
Saeko-san, run for it!{"Run, Saeko-san!" to "Saeko-san, run for it!" -A0}

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:09.050
Saeko-san!

