Komuro-kun?

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:23.460
Komuro-ku—

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:26.650
If you need a reason, I'll give you one!

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:30.820
Saeko, no matter how dirty your hands are,

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:34.970
I'll always look up to you!

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:38.760
I think you're the coolest girl I've ever met!

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:40.180
So don't just die!

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:42.220
I don't wanna die!

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:47.440
Please, keep living! For my sake!

