Kirari Yurari Hikari Tobashi Machikogarete Iru

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:58.120
This twinkling, swaying, luminous surge is longing

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:58.120
キラリゆらり　ヒカリとばし　待ち焦がれている

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:07.370
Junjou ni Torawareta Angel no Eyes

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:07.370
for the eyes of an angel held captive by purity

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:07.370
純情に捕らわれた　Angel no Eyes

00:22:30.330 --> 00:22:32.000
Why are we out back?

00:22:32.380 --> 00:22:34.940
If they want to slip in, 
they'll have to do it through the back.

00:22:38.740 --> 00:22:39.460
Zeke?

00:22:42.940 --> 00:22:43.900
Onii-chan!

00:22:57.380 --> 00:22:58.310
Open it up already.

00:22:58.880 --> 00:22:59.290
Okay!

00:23:01.530 --> 00:23:03.300
Onii-chan! Onee-chan!

00:23:08.350 --> 00:23:11.890
<i>I accepted her darkness.</i>

00:23:13.900 --> 00:23:14.410
<i>Actually...</i>

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:16.940
<i>I accepted everything that the end brought.</i>

00:23:18.780 --> 00:23:21.540
<i>Obviously, I did this in order to survive.</i>

00:23:26.610 --> 00:23:27.120
Right now, we are...{wareware...}

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:27.590
Takagi...

00:23:27.660 --> 00:23:29.080
I wouldn't think any less of them!{sasuga yo!}

00:23:29.080 --> 00:23:31.790
My parents really are something else!{honto ni sugoi yo! atashi no papa to mama!}

00:23:33.050 --> 00:23:33.880
Don't get in my way!{jama...blah}

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:35.960
You can't even fire a gun!{matome... blah}
